  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funafuti Water Supply and Sanitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has the dual objectives of (i) enhancing the well-being and quality of life for the residents of Funafuti atoll by providing improved drinking water supply and sanitation services; and (ii) building the resilience of Funafuti residents to the projected impacts of climate change. For the first time, Tuvalu will construct a reticulated water supply network, which will benefit more than half of the country&#x2019;s population.</narrative>
  </description>
